Ben (Solutions): Added schema validation tests and a small harness for webhook delay tuning.

Tom (SRE): Noted VPC egress and allowlist steps. I'll also include a short snippet on how we support Partner HSMs in Dedicated/Private builds.

Ellen (Sales Eng): One more ask — legal wants to see precedent for customer-managed HSMs in Dedicated; if we have a redacted appendix I'll include it in the pricing packet.

Jess (Product): We do. I'll paste the redacted policy snippet and recommended RBAC for key use.

Priya (AE): Thanks team — ping me if blockers. Meeting invite incoming. :calendar:
